The following bug has been found in the official binaries for Amiga
NetHack 3.1.1:
	numberpad is broken if set from inside HackWB
		Workaround: set number_pad in NetHack.cnf (note the spelling)
		and NOT in HackWB

Several other bugs have been reported but not yet confirmed:
	crashes on exit
	scores from HackWB doesn't work

Also, let me repeat one note:
	save files and bones files from earlier versions including 3.1.0
	are NOT compatible with 3.1.1 and must be deleted

We would appreciate the following information from anyone who can provide it:
	confirmation of any of the unconfirmed bugs (it happens to me)
	refutatation of any of the unconfirmed bugs (it doesn't happen to me)
Please include your system configuration in any report.  We especially
would like to hear from people using AmigaDOS version 3.

If anyone has ANY other bugs that have not been reported PLEASE let us know
about them - if you don't report it the odds are we will not get it
fixed.

My apologies for not finding all the bugs (as if we ever could :-) and my
thanks for your help in finding them.

Ken Lorber
